# NV-01 — Quan ly dang nhap

UC: 1-8  
Actors: public user, internal officer, system administrator  
Status: UC-1/2 mocked; VNeID screen mocked; real VNeID adapter blocked pending API credentials.

## Scope

Internal login/logout, password recovery/change, lock and expiry, profile update, 2FA activation, public VNeID/SSO sign-in, session expiry and login audit.

## Acceptance criteria

- VNeID starts from `/portal/login/vneid`, exposes ready/checking/success/error states, and never claims a real verification.
- Internal roles enter through `/workspace/login`; route, action and data-scope guards remain independent.
- Logout clears the demo session; expired/locked sessions cannot access protected routes.
- Personal identity data is masked in notifications and logs.

## Test mapping

`auth.service.spec.ts`, `auth.guards.spec.ts`, `vneid-login.component.spec.ts` (to be extended per UC).

